  "description": {
    "en": "HEAD Lynx Tour is a performance-oriented co-polyester monofilament designed for intermediate to advanced players who hit aggressively and want a strong combination of control and spin. Its six-edge shaped profile grips the ball to enhance spin and directional accuracy, while a newer co-polymer mixture improves durability without making the string excessively harsh. The 1.20 mm gauge emphasizes spin and feel, the 1.25 mm version provides the best all-around balance, and the 1.30 mm version maximizes durability and stability.",

    "zh": "HEAD Lynx Tour 是一款面向中高级及竞技型球员的高性能共聚酯单丝球线，核心特点是强控制、高旋转以及优秀耐久性。独特的六棱形截面能够增强球线对网球的咬合，从而提升旋转能力和落点控制；新的共聚物配方则在提高耐久性的同时，尽量避免传统硬质聚酯过于生硬的击球感。1.20毫米版本更强调旋转与手感；1.25毫米版本综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久性与稳定性。"
  },

